453-1.194-29.356-10.074-38.002-19.521z\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"jsx-206f8ab771ecb1f9\"><h2 class=\"jsx-206f8ab771ecb1f9 text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2\">Agreement to Terms</h2><p class=\"jsx-206f8ab771ecb1f9 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">These Terms and Conditions (&quot;Terms&quot;) govern your use of the services provided by Christmas Lights Over Columbus (&quot;Company,&quot; &quot;we,&quot; &quot;us,&quot; or &quot;our&quot;). By accessing or using our services, you agree to be bound by these Terms. If you disagree with any part of these Terms, please do not use our services.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"jsx-206f8ab771ecb1f9 p-6 sm:p-8 space-y-8\"><div class=\"jsx-206f8ab771ecb1f9 space-y-4\"><div class=\"jsx-206f8ab771ecb1f9 flex items-center gap-3\"><div class=\"jsx-206f8ab771ecb1f9 w-8 h-8 bg-emerald-100 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" viewBox=\"0 0 576 512\" class=\"w-4 h-4 text-emerald-600\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M218.17 424.14c-2.95-5.92-8.09-6.52-10.17-6.52s-7.22.59-10.02 6.19l-7.67 15.34c-6.37 12.78-25.03 11.37-29.48-2.09L144 386.59l-10.61 31.88c-5.89 17.66-22.38 29.53-41 29.53H80c-8.84 0-16-7.16-16-16s7.16-16 16-16h12.39c4.83 0 9.11-3.08 10.64-7.66l18.19-54.64c3.3-9.81 12.44-16.41 22.78-16.41s19.48 6.59 22.77 16.41l13.88 41.64c19.75-16.19 54.06-9.7 66 14.16 1.89 3.78 5.49 5.95 9.36 6.26v-82.12l128-127.09V160H248c-13.2 0-24-10.8-24-24V0H24C10.7 0 0 10.7 0 24v464c0 13.3 10.7 24 24 24h336c13.3 0 24-10.7 24-24v-40l-128-.11c-16.12-.31-30.58-9.28-37.83-23.75zM384 121.9c0-6.3-2.5-12.4-7-16.9L279.1 7c-4.5-4.5-10.6-7-17-7H256v128h128v-6.1zm-96 225.06V416h68.99l161.68-162.78-67.88-67.88L288 346.96zm280.54-179.63l-31.87-31.87c-9.94-9.94-26.07-9.94-36.01 0l-27.25 27.25 67.88 67.88 27.25-27.25c9.95-9.94 9.95-26.07 0-36.01z\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"jsx-206f8ab771ecb1f9 text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900\">1. Service Agreement</h3></div><div class=\"jsx-206f8ab771ecb1f9 pl-11 space-y-3 text-gray-600\"><p class=\"jsx-206f8ab771ecb1f9\"><span class=\"jsx-206f8ab771ecb1f9 font-medium text-gray-900\">1.1 Service Scope:</span> Christmas Lights Over Columbus agrees to provide professional holiday lighting installation, maintenance, and removal services as described in your service agreement.</p><p class=\"jsx-206f8ab771ecb1f9\"><span class=\"jsx-206f8ab771ecb1f9 font-medium text-gray-900\">1.2 Service Period:</span> The service period begins on the installation date and continues through the agreed-upon removal date. Any changes to this schedule require written notice at least 48 hours in advance.</p><p class=\"jsx-206f8ab771ecb1f9\"><span class=\"jsx-206f8ab771ecb1f9 font-medium text-gray-900\">1.3 Weather Delays:</span> We reserve the right to reschedule services due to inclement weather or unsafe conditions. We will make every effort to notify you promptly and reschedule at the earliest available time.</p></div></div><div class=\"jsx-206f8ab771ecb1f9 space-y-4\"><div class=\"jsx-206f8ab771ecb1f9 flex items-center gap-3\"><div class=\"jsx-206f8ab771ecb1f9 w-8 h-8 bg-emerald-100 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" viewBox=\"0 0 640 512\" class=\"w-4 h-4 text-emerald-600\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M621.16 54.46C582.37 38.19 543.55 32 504.75 32c-123.17-.01-246.33 62.34-369.5 62.34-30.89 0-61.76-3.92-92.65-13.72-3.47-1.1-6.95-1.62-10.35-1.62C15.04 79 0 92.32 0 110.81v317.26c0 12.63 7.23 24.6 18.84 29.46C57.63 473.81 96.45 480 135.25 480c123.17 0 246.34-62.35 369.51-62.35 30.89 0 61.76 3.92 92.65 13.72 3.47 1.1 6.95 1.62 10.35 1.62 17.21 0 32.25-13.32 32.25-31.81V83.93c-.01-12.64-7.24-24.6-18.85-29.47zM48 132.22c20.12 5.04 41.12 7.57 62.72 8.93C104.84 170.54 79 192.69 48 192.69v-60.47zm0 285v-47.78c34.37 0 62.18 27.27 63.71 61.4-22.53-1.81-43.59-6.31-63.71-13.62zM320 352c-44.19 0-80-42.99-80-96 0-53.02 35.82-96 80-96s80 42.98 80 96c0 53.03-35.83 96-80 96zm272 27.78c-17.52-4.39-35.71-6.85-54.32-8.44 5.87-26.08 27.5-45.88 54.32-49.28v57.72zm0-236.11c-30.89-3.91-54.86-29.7-55.81-61.55 19.54 2.17 38.09 6.23 55.81 12.66v48.89z\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"jsx-206f8ab771ecb1f9 text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900\">2. Pricing &amp; Payments</h3></div><div class=\"jsx-206f8ab771ecb1f9 pl-11 space-y-3 text-gray-600\"><p class=\"jsx-206f8ab771ecb1f9\"><span class=\"jsx-206f8ab771ecb1f9 font-medium text-gray-900\">2.1 Pricing:</span> All prices are quoted in USD and are valid for 30 days from the date of the quote. Prices include labor, materials, and standard installation unless otherwise specified.</p><p class=\"jsx-206f8ab771ecb1f9\"><span class=\"jsx-206f8ab771ecb1f9 font-medium text-gray-900\">2.2 Payment Terms:</span> A 50% deposit is required to secure your installation date. The remaining balance is due upon completion of installation. We accept major credit cards, checks, and electronic payments.</p><p class=\"jsx-206f8ab771ecb1f9\"><span class=\"jsx-206f8ab771ecb1f9 font-medium text-gray-900\">2.3 Cancellation Policy:</span> Cancellations made more than 7 days before installation receive a full refund of deposit. Cancellations within 7 days of installation may forfeit the deposit.</p></div></div><div class=\"jsx-206f8ab771ecb1f9 space-y-4\"><div class=\"jsx-206f8ab771ecb1f9 flex items-center gap-3\"><div class=\"jsx-206f8ab771ecb1f9 w-8 h-8 bg-emerald-100 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" class=\"w-4 h-4 text-emerald-600\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M466.5 83.7l-192-80a48.15 48.15 0 0 0-36.9 0l-192 80C27.7 91.1 16 108.6 16 128c0 198.5 114.5 335.7 221.5 380.3 11.8 4.9 25.1 4.9 36.9 0C360.1 472.6 496 349.3 496 128c0-19.4-11.7-36.9-29.5-44.3zM256.1 446.3l-.1-381 175.9 73.3c-3.3 151.4-82.1 261.1-175.8 307.7z\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"jsx-206f8ab771ecb1f9 text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900\">3. Liability &amp; Insurance</h3></div><div class=\"jsx-206f8ab771ecb1f9 pl-11 space-y-3 text-gray-600\"><p class=\"jsx-206f8ab771ecb1f9\"><span class=\"jsx-206f8ab771ecb1f9 font-medium text-gray-900\">3.1 Insurance Coverage:</span> Christmas Lights Over Columbus carries full liability insurance and workers&#x27; compensation coverage. Proof of insurance is available upon request.</p><p class=\"jsx-206f8ab771ecb1f9\"><span class=\"jsx-206f8ab771ecb1f9 font-medium text-gray-900\">3.2 Property Damage:</span> We take utmost care with your property. In the unlikely event of damage, we will work with you and our insurance provider to address the issue promptly.</p><p class=\"jsx-206f8ab771ecb1f9\"><span class=\"jsx-206f8ab771ecb1f9 font-medium text-gray-900\">3.3 Equipment:</span> All lights and equipment remain the property of Christmas Lights Over Columbus unless explicitly purchased. Any damage to our equipment due to customer negligence may result in replacement costs.</p></div></div><div class=\"jsx-206f8ab771ecb1f9 space-y-4\"><div class=\"jsx-206f8ab771ecb1f9 flex items-center gap-3\"><div class=\"jsx-206f8ab771ecb1f9 w-8 h-8 bg-emerald-100 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" class=\"w-4 h-4 text-emerald-600\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M504.971 199.362l-22.627-22.627c-9.373-9.373-24.569-9.373-33.941 0l-5.657 5.657L329.608 69.255l5.657-5.657c9.373-9.373 9.373-24.569 0-33.941L312.638 7.029c-9.373-9.373-24.569-9.373-33.941 0L154.246 131.48c-9.373 9.373-9.373 24.569 0 33.941l22.627 22.627c9.373 9.373 24.569 9.373 33.941 0l5.657-5.657 39.598 39.598-81.04 81.04-5.657-5.657c-12.497-12.497-32.758-12.497-45.255 0L9.373 412.118c-12.497 12.497-12.497 32.758 0 45.255l45.255 45.255c12.497 12.497 32.758 12.497 45.255 0l114.745-114.745c12.497-12.497 12.497-32.758 0-45.255l-5.657-5.657 81.04-81.04 39.598 39.598-5.657 5.657c-9.373 9.373-9.373 24.569 0 33.941l22.627 22.627c9.373 9.373 24.569 9.373 33.941 0l124.451-124.451c9.372-9.372 9.372-24.568 0-33.941z\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"jsx-206f8ab771ecb1f9 text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900\">4. Customer Responsibilities</h3></div><div class=\"jsx-206f8ab771ecb1f9 pl-11 space-y-3 text-gray-600\"><p class=\"jsx-206f8ab771ecb1f9\"><span class=\"jsx-206f8ab771ecb1f9 font-medium text-gray-900\">4.1 Access:</span> Customers must provide clear access to all installation areas. This includes unlocked gates, clear pathways, and notification of any potential hazards.</p><p class=\"jsx-206f8ab771ecb1f9\"><span class=\"jsx-206f8ab771ecb1f9 font-medium text-gray-900\">4.2 Electrical Requirements:</span> Working outdoor electrical outlets must be available within 100 feet of installation areas. Additional fees may apply for generator rental if needed.</p><p class=\"jsx-206f8ab771ecb1f9\"><span class=\"jsx-206f8ab771ecb1f9 font-medium text-gray-900\">4.3 Storage:</span> If storing lights between seasons, customers must provide a clean, dry, secure location. We are not responsible for stored equipment damaged by environmental factors.</p></div></div><div class=\"jsx-206f8ab771ecb1f9 space-y-4\"><div class=\"jsx-206f8ab771ecb1f9 flex items-center gap-3\"><div class=\"jsx-206f8ab771ecb1f9 w-8 h-8 bg-emerald-100 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" viewBox=\"0 0 576 512\" class=\"w-4 h-4 text-emerald-600\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M569.517 440.013C587.975 472.007 564.806 512 527.94 512H48.054c-36.937 0-59.999-40.055-41.577-71.987L246.423 23.985c18.467-32.009 64.72-31.951 83.154 0l239.94 416.028zM288 354c-25.405 0-46 20.595-46 46s20.595 46 46 46 46-20.595 46-46-20.595-46-46-46zm-43.673-165.346l7.418 136c.347 6.364 5.609 11.346 11.982 11.346h48.546c6.373 0 11.635-4.982 11.982-11.346l7.418-136c.375-6.874-5.098-12.654-11.982-12.654h-63.383c-6.884 0-12.356 5.78-11.981 12.654z\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"jsx-206f8ab771ecb1f9 text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900\">5. Safety &amp; Compliance</h3></div><div class=\"jsx-206f8ab771ecb1f9 pl-11 space-y-3 text-gray-600\"><p class=\"jsx-206f8ab771ecb1f9\"><span class=\"jsx-206f8ab771ecb1f9 font-medium text-gray-900\">5.1 Safety Standards:</span> All installations comply with local electrical codes and industry safety standards. Our team is trained in proper ladder safety and electrical protocols.</p><p class=\"jsx-206f8ab771ecb1f9\"><span class=\"jsx-206f8ab771ecb1f9 font-medium text-gray-900\">5.2 Modifications:</span> Customers should not modify, adjust, or attempt to repair installed lighting. Contact us immediately if you notice any issues.</p><p class=\"jsx-206f8ab771ecb1f9\"><span class=\"jsx-206f8ab771ecb1f9 font-medium text-gray-900\">5.3 Emergency Situations:</span> In case of emergency or hazardous conditions (downed wires, etc.), call 911 immediately, then contact our emergency line at (614) 301-7100.</p></div></div><div class=\"jsx-206f8ab771ecb1f9 space-y-4\"><div class=\"jsx-206f8ab771ecb1f9 flex items-center gap-3\"><div class=\"jsx-206f8ab771ecb1f9 w-8 h-8 bg-emerald-100 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" class=\"w-4 h-4 text-emerald-600\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M383.9 308.3l23.9-62.6c4-10.5-3.7-21.7-15-21.7h-58.5c11-18.9 17.8-40.6 17.8-64v-.3c39.2-7.8 64-19.1 64-31.7 0-13.3-27.3-25.1-70.1-33-9.2-32.8-27-65.8-40.6-82.8-9.5-11.9-25.9-15.6-39.5-8.8l-27.6 13.8c-9 4.5-19.6 4.5-28.6 0L182.1 3.4c-13.6-6.8-30-3.1-39.5 8.8-13.5 17-31.4 50-40.6 82.8-42.7 7.9-70 19.7-70 33 0 12.6 24.8 23.9 64 31.7v.3c0 23.4 6.8 45.1 17.8 64H56.3c-11.5 0-19.2 11.7-14.7 22.3l25.8 60.2C27.3 329.8 0 372.7 0 422.4v44.8C0 491.9 20.1 512 44.8 512h358.4c24.7 0 44.8-20.1 44.8-44.8v-44.8c0-48.4-25.8-90.4-64.1-114.1zM176 480l-41.6-192 49.6 32 24 40-32 120zm96 0l-32-120 24-40 49.6-32L272 480zm41.7-298.5c-3.9 11.9-7 24.6-16.5 33.4-10.1 9.3-48 22.4-64-25-2.8-8.4-15.4-8.4-18.3 0-17 50.2-56 32.4-64 25-9.5-8.8-12.7-21.5-16.5-33.4-.8-2.5-6.3-5.7-6.3-5.8v-10.8c28.3 3.6 61 5.8 96 5.8s67.7-2.1 96-5.8v10.8c-.1.1-5.6 3.2-6.4 5.8z\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"jsx-206f8ab771ecb1f9 text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900\">6. Privacy &amp; Data</h3></div><div class=\"jsx-206f8ab771ecb1f9 pl-11 space-y-3 text-gray-600\"><p class=\"jsx-206f8ab771ecb1f9\"><span class=\"jsx-206f8ab771ecb1f9 font-medium text-gray-900\">6.1 Information Collection:</span> We collect necessary personal information to provide our services. This includes name, address, phone number, email, and property details relevant to installation.</p><p class=\"jsx-206f8ab771ecb1f9\"><span class=\"jsx-206f8ab771ecb1f9 font-medium text-gray-900\">6.2 Data Usage:</span> Your information is used solely for service delivery, communication, and marketing communications you&#x27;ve opted into. We never sell your information to third parties.</p><p class=\"jsx-206f8ab771ecb1f9\"><span class=\"jsx-206f8ab771ecb1f9 font-medium text-gray-900\">6.3 Photography:</span> We may photograph completed work for our portfolio and marketing. Please notify us in writing if you prefer your property not be photographed.</p></div></div><div class=\"jsx-206f8ab771ecb1f9 space-y-4\"><div class=\"jsx-206f8ab771ecb1f9 flex items-center gap-3\"><div class=\"jsx-206f8ab771ecb1f9 w-8 h-8 bg-emerald-100 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" class=\"w-4 h-4 text-emerald-600\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M504 256c0 136.967-111.033 248-248 248S8 392.967 8 256 119.033 8 256 8s248 111.033 248 248zM227.314 387.314l184-184c6.248-6.248 6.248-16.379 0-22.627l-22.627-22.627c-6.248-6.249-16.379-6.249-22.628 0L216 308.118l-70.059-70.059c-6.248-6.248-16.379-6.248-22.628 0l-22.627 22.627c-6.248 6.248-6.248 16.379 0 22.627l104 104c6.249 6.249 16.379 6.249 22.628.001z\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"jsx-206f8ab771ecb1f9 text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900\">7. Warranties &amp; Guarantees</h3></div><div class=\"jsx-206f8ab771ecb1f9 pl-11 space-y-3 text-gray-600\"><p class=\"jsx-206f8ab771ecb1f9\"><span class=\"jsx-206f8ab771ecb1f9 font-medium text-gray-900\">7.1 Workmanship Guarantee:</span> We guarantee our installation workmanship for the entire holiday season. If any issues arise due to our installation, we&#x27;ll address them promptly at no charge.</p><p class=\"jsx-206f8ab771ecb1f9\"><span class=\"jsx-206f8ab771ecb1f9 font-medium text-gray-900\">7.2 Equipment Warranty:</span> Manufacturer warranties apply to all lighting products. We&#x27;ll assist with warranty claims for defective equipment.</p><p class=\"jsx-206f8ab771ecb1f9\"><span class=\"jsx-206f8ab771ecb1f9 font-medium text-gray-900\">7.3 Satisfaction:</span> Your satisfaction is our priority. If you&#x27;re unhappy with any aspect of our service, please contact us within 48 hours so we can make it right.</p></div></div><div class=\"jsx-206f8ab771ecb1f9 space-y-4\"><div class=\"jsx-206f8ab771ecb1f9 flex items-center gap-3\"><div class=\"jsx-206f8ab771ecb1f9 w-8 h-8 bg-emerald-100 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" class=\"w-4 h-4 text-emerald-600\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M0 464c0 26.5 21.5 48 48 48h352c26.5 0 48-21.5 48-48V192H0v272zm320-196c0-6.6 5.4-12 12-12h40c6.6 0 12 5.4 12 12v40c0 6.6-5.4 12-12 12h-40c-6.6 0-12-5.4-12-12v-40zm0 128c0-6.6 5.4-12 12-12h40c6.6 0 12 5.4 12 12v40c0 6.6-5.4 12-12 12h-40c-6.6 0-12-5.4-12-12v-40zM192 268c0-6.6 5.4-12 12-12h40c6.6 0 12 5.4 12 12v40c0 6.6-5.4 12-12 12h-40c-6.6 0-12-5.4-12-12v-40zm0 128c0-6.6 5.4-12 12-12h40c6.6 0 12 5.4 12 12v40c0 6.6-5.4 12-12 12h-40c-6.6 0-12-5.4-12-12v-40zM64 268c0-6.6 5.4-12 12-12h40c6.6 0 12 5.4 12 12v40c0 6.6-5.4 12-12 12H76c-6.6 0-12-5.4-12-12v-40zm0 128c0-6.6 5.4-12 12-12h40c6.6 0 12 5.4 12 12v40c0 6.6-5.4 12-12 12H76c-6.6 0-12-5.4-12-12v-40zM400 64h-48V16c0-8.8-7.2-16-16-16h-32c-8.8 0-16 7.2-16 16v48H160V16c0-8.8-7.2-16-16-16h-32c-8.8 0-16 7.2-16 16v48H48C21.5 64 0 85.5 0 112v48h448v-48c0-26.5-21.5-48-48-48z\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"jsx-206f8ab771ecb1f9 text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900\">8. Season-Long Services</h3></div><div class=\"jsx-206f8ab771ecb1f9 pl-11 space-y-3 text-gray-600\"><p class=\"jsx-206f8ab771ecb1f9\"><span class=\"jsx-206f8ab771ecb1f9 font-medium text-gray-900\">8.1 Maintenance Visits:</span> For customers with season-long service packages, we provide scheduled maintenance visits. Additional visits may incur extra charges.</p><p class=\"jsx-206f8ab771ecb1f9\"><span class=\"jsx-206f8ab771ecb1f9 font-medium text-gray-900\">8.2 Bulb Replacement:</span> We replace burnt-out bulbs during scheduled maintenance. Emergency replacements may be available for an additional fee.</p><p class=\"jsx-206f8ab771ecb1f9\"><span class=\"jsx-206f8ab771ecb1f9 font-medium text-gray-900\">8.3 End-of-Season Removal:</span> Removal is scheduled within 2 weeks after the holiday season. Please ensure access to your property during this time.</p></div></div><div class=\"jsx-206f8ab771ecb1f9 space-y-4\"><div class=\"jsx-206f8ab771ecb1f9 flex items-center gap-3\"><div class=\"jsx-206f8ab771ecb1f9 w-8 h-8 bg-emerald-100 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" class=\"w-4 h-4 text-emerald-600\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M504.971 199.362l-22.627-22.627c-